OL,3,GNEWSA'I don't have a buoyancy aid':
OL,4,ALiving without the Bank of Mum and Dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuying a home or even moving into a
OL,7,Frented property is an increasingly
OL,8,Funrealistic dream for many young
OL,9,Fpeople.
OL,11,FThis summer, BBC Your Voice revealed
OL,12,Fmore than 40% of 25-year-olds were now
OL,13,Fliving with their parents. Dozens of
OL,14,Fyoung people told us they were having
OL,15,Fto rely on the so-called Bank of Mum
OL,16,Fand Dad to help cover rent, bills and
OL,17,Fother living costs.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
